    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Flight Search Tool\nby Henry Oyedeji · henry-oyedeji.netlify.app\n\nSearches Google Flights for one-way fares, keeps the 10 cheapest, and adds each price in **naira** at the official CBN rate.\n\n### Setup (5 minutes)\n1. Get a free API key at **serpapi.com**.\n2. Open **HTTP Request** → Credential → create *Query Auth*: Name `api_key`, Value = your key.\n3. Click **Test it** to run the sample route (Lagos → London, two weeks from today).\n\n### Use it from an AI agent\nAdd a *Call n8n Workflow Tool* to your agent and pick this workflow. Inputs: `departure_id`, `arrival_id` (airport codes like LOS, ABV, LHR) and `outbound_date` (YYYY-MM-DD).\n\nWant it changed — return trips, other currencies, email quotes? WhatsApp 08147754921.",
